<title>NEW ZEALAND: ANZ cuts NZ 1-yr fixed mortgage rate to 10.5 pct.</title>
<headline>ANZ cuts NZ 1-yr fixed mortgage rate to 10.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ and its Postbank subsidiary said on Friday they would cut their New Zealand one-year fixed mortgage lending rate to 10.5 percent from 10.65 percent, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The variable rate remained at 11.5 percent and the three-year fixed rate at 10.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
